  "keyFeatures": [
    "Connect any AI model (OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, Ollama, OpenRouter, and 20+ more) with your own API keys",
    "AI Agents with custom instructions, knowledge bases, and multi-agent workflows",
    "Extensible plugin system with built-in plugins (web search, image generation, Zapier, etc.) and custom plugin builder",
    "Model Context Protocol (MCP) support for connecting to external tools and services",
    "Rich chat management: projects, folders, threads, fork/edit, canvas editor, share/export",
    "Prompt library with templates and variables",
    "RAG knowledge base for document-grounded AI responses",
    "Voice input (speech-to-text) and text-to-speech with ElevenLabs support",
    "Cloud sync and backup across devices",
    "TypingMind Team: white-labeled workspace with user management, analytics, and SSO",
    "Static self-hosting option for maximum privacy",
    "LLM automated workflows",
    "Interactive Canvas (Artifacts) for code and document editing",
    "Deep Research plugin for comprehensive AI-powered research"
  ],
